  "description": {
    "text": "Players in Battle Carnival 2011's Victory Cup who won three games in a row in the Challenge Stage moved up to the Premier Stage, where they played on until they lost to set the longest winning streak; the best streaks went on to the Climax Stage that afternoon. Everyone who reached the Premier Stage got two mirror holo Item cards stamped with the event's logo, Level Ball and Heavy Ball. The Battle Carnival was held in Osaka on 5 and 6 November and in Tokyo on 19 and 20 November 2011.",
